WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
A mountain in the
desert, wrapped in smoke.

2
00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:07.210
Thunder, fire, and the blast of a horn.

3
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:09.640
At its foot waits a whole people.

4
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.130
For three days they have prepared.

5
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.070
The Torah says this is Mount Sinai.

6
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.660
Before the commandments are
given, the people answer together:

7
00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:21.850
All that the LORD hath spoken we will do.

8
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.680
So why did a whole people agree to
God's laws before hearing them all?

9
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.230
In this mission, you'll count the
Ten Commandments the Jewish way,

10
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.080
and see why most Christians
count them differently.

11
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:38.040
Then you'll find out how ten statements
relate to the 613 commandments of Jewish

12
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.000
law.

13
00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.750
Your mission: find out why a whole people
agreed to God's laws before hearing

14
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.360
them all.
